-- GENERATED by tools/biome_map_builder.py from assets/maps/open-world/biome-placement-v1.json (data Adler-32 3961102115).
-- Do not edit by hand. The 7 open-world roads from the hub gate trail ends to each biome's entry gate, as
-- anchored collidable primitive slabs; a stretch two roads share is one slab. Run once from the command bar in Edit mode:
--     require(game.ServerStorage.WildboundBiomeBuilders.<this module>).run()
-- It reuses or replaces only its own root model and adds no scripts.
local Builder = {}

